	'messages:temp-user-banner-tooltip-description-learn-more' => 'se:Dat gaskaboddosaš geavaheaddjidovddaldat ráhkaduvvui dan maŋŋá go muhtin dan neahttalohkkiin ja ovttadagain lea rievdadan siiddu geavaheaddjidovddaldaga haga. [[mw:Help:Temporary_accounts|Loga eambbo]].',
	'messages:temp-user-banner-tooltip-description-login' => 'se:[[Special:UserLogin|Čálit sisa]] dahje [[Special:CreateAccount|ásat geavaheaddjidovddaldaga]] lasihan dihte boahttevaš rievdademiid alccet ja oažžut beassanlobi eará doaimmaide.',
